  "description": "The gate for an ai-sdlc governed solution. A change moves through intent, spec, plan, build, verify and land; each artifact is challenged against a fixed set of rules before it advances, a person approves the three planning documents against a hash of each, and nothing merges unless the chain is complete, approved and hash-matched. This is the deterministic half: the `sdlc` command that every host hook, git hook and pipeline step calls. The stages need language and ship separately as the plugin.",
